              "42": "Checking the door and cover",
              "43": "Calibrating the laser",
              "44": "Checking the platform",
              "45": "Checking the bird's-eye camera",
              "46": "Calibrating the bird's-eye camera",
              "47": "Levelling the bed, phase 1",
